            Paste or type your text below to instantly count words, characters,
            sentences, paragraphs, and reading time.
        </p>

        <!-- Settings the script reads (same values as the page text) -->
        <div
            id="calc-config"
            data-limits={JSON.stringify(LIMITS)}
