            <li>Paste or type your text into the box above.</li>
            <li>
                The counts update in real time. Check the character limits to
                see how much room you have for a post or description.
            </li>
            <li>
                Use the "Copy Text" button to copy your text, or "Clear" to
                start over.
            </li>
        </ol>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-6 mb-3">What Gets Counted</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
            <li>
                <strong>Words:</strong> Groups of characters separated by spaces or
                line breaks.
            </li>
            <li>
